        <abstract>
            The dataset presents a chapter of the <ulink url="https://www.gbif.org/dataset/search?keyword=Digital%20Catalogue%20of%20Biodiversity%20of%20Poland"><citetitle>Digital Catalogue of Biodiversity of Poland</citetitle></ulink>, comprising taxa of (infra)specific level, reported from Poland in the present administrative boundaries of the country. In this instance of the Catalogue, the list includes only taxa of confirmed occurrence, ignoring doubtful records that need verification as well as synonyms and other not valid names. The occurrence of each species is supported by a published reference.
        </abstract>
